    values:originalText "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the following sub-section: \"(5) Nothing in this section renders unlawful an act in relation to employment, or an application for employment, in a dwelling-house or flat occupied by the person who did the act or a person on whose behalf the act was done or by a relative of either of those persons.\". Advertisements" ;
    skos:definition "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the following sub-section: \"(5) Nothing in this section renders unlawful an act in relation to employment, or an application for employment, in a dwelling-house or flat occupied by the person who did the act or a person on whose behalf the act was done or by a relative of either of those persons.\". Advertisements"@en ;
