    skos:prefLabel "33 Section 33"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33 ;
    values:originalText "Where— (a) before the commencement time, a person had received, in accordance with sub-section 24 (3) of the Racial Discrimination Act 1975, a certificate stating the matters referred to in paragraph 24 (3) (a) or (b) of that Act signed by a member of the former Commission or by the former Commissioner; and (b) at the commencement time, the person had not instituted a proceeding under sub-section 24 (1) of that Act, then, for the purposes of the institution of any proceeding by the person after the commencement time, the certificate so received by the person shall be deemed to state the matters referred to in paragraph 24 (3) (a) or (b) of the Principal Act as amended by this Act and to have been signed by a member of the Commission, or by the Race Discrimination Commissioner, as the case may be. Delegations by former Commission and former Commissioner" ;
    skos:definition "Where— (a) before the commencement time, a person had received, in accordance with sub-section 24 (3) of the Racial Discrimination Act 1975, a certificate stating the matters referred to in paragraph 24 (3) (a) or (b) of that Act signed by a member of the former Commission or by the former Commissioner; and (b) at the commencement time, the person had not instituted a proceeding under sub-section 24 (1) of that Act, then, for the purposes of the institution of any proceeding by the person after the commencement time, the certificate so received by the person shall be deemed to state the matters referred to in paragraph 24 (3) (a) or (b) of the Principal Act as amended by this Act and to have been signed by a member of the Commission, or by the Race Discrimination Commissioner, as the case may be. Delegations by former Commission and former Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a228ebf257516d6a5fd1a0e7a9ac77c25dcb981e598889f537c190c059894b7c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
