concept:c2004a03367-sec-44 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44 Section 44"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-44 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 97 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from sub-section (1) \"5 years\" and substituting \"7 years\". (2) The amendment made by sub-section (1) does not affect the appointment, or the term of office, of the person who, immediately before the commencement of this section, held office as the Sex Discrimination Commissioner. Non-disclosure of private information" ;
